        "slc_d6d62aae43376cf206ac9c6631a3b4aab13bc6646b777d4b3a4278ea007ea44b"
      ],
      "text": "MCP is the standard tool boundary: servers connect via stdio or HTTP transports, tools are namespaced as <server><sep><tool>, and every invocation passes through the ApprovalManager."
    },
    {
