      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_724888c4dbde2a55fb46149bea52da273667cb43a6a1eb0b3eb4ec4ea58983eb"
      ],
      "text": "Agent behavior is modeled as AgentProfile entities managed by agent-profile-manager.ts, with system prompts assembled via a prompts system supporting placeholder substitution; subagents are profiles invoked by a parent profile."
    },
