  "summary": "Selected evidence records: The agent runtime is built on the Vercel AI SDK; SDK message parts are the runtime currency, while persistence uses AiderDesk's own ContextMessage types, converted at the agent boundary in src/main/agent/utils.ts. MCP is the standard tool boundary: servers connect via stdio or HTTP transports, tools are namespaced as <server><sep><tool>, and every invocation passes through the ApprovalManager.",
